WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:03.550
Masaru. Tohma.

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:05.750
From now on, you two will be a team.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:09.380
You want me... to act alongside him?

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:15.290
Under Captain Satsuma's orders, Masaru and Tohma were put together as a team.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.050
But their teamwork was virtually non-existent.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:21.350
It's because he got in my way!

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:23.020
Nothing about my plans was flawed!

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:26.950
Because their personalities clashed and they couldn't work in harmony,

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:30.960
they allowed Drimogemon to escape to the Digital World.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.020
Drimogemon

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.020
Adult Level

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.220
What's wrong?

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:36.480
What's that?

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:43.860
Mega Burst!

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.170
Spiral Blow!

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:53.130
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:56.100
Their attacks are canceling each other out!

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:00.850
I refuse to be in a team with you any longer!

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.810
Good! I'm out, too!

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:10.690
To fulfill his duty, Tohma went to the Digital World to chase down Drimogemon.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:16.610
The Digital Dive...

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:22.040
This is the worst...

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.560
Hey. Nobody's here, right?

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:25.860
Yeah. It's fine, Aniki.

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:27.280
Right then, let's go!

00:01:29.490 --> 00:01:30.870
Successful infiltration!

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:32.840
We're so smooth, Aniki!

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:34.160
What are you doing?

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:37.970
Tohma did a Digital Dive?

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:40.540
Damn it, he got away before us!

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:41.220
Before you?

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:42.550
Nothing, he's just talking to himself.

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:45.430
What was he thinking?

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:48.920
Doing a Dive when the equipment hasn't even been tested on humans...

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:50.150
Anything could have happened!

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.860
Please be safe, Tohma...

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:54.820
Got him!

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:56.540
Huh? What's that?

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:58.720
Tohma's Digivice signal.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.030
I'll drag him right ba-

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:04.350
What's wrong?

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:05.900
I lost him.

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:06.690
Really.

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:08.590
Well, isn't that a pity.

00:02:08.590 --> 00:02:09.540
Yoshino.

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:12.460
I'm gonna do a Digital Dive, too.

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.760
Listen to me! It's dangerous!

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:17.430
That doesn't matter!

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:19.680
I'm just going there to settle my fight!

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:22.690
Who cares about your fight?

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:25.060
You're just going to make things worse!

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:25.390
Hey!

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:28.120
It's not doing anything! How do I make this thing work?

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.820
You're not even listening to me...

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:31.670
Don't look at me. Just give up.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:32.060
Hey!

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:34.520
Damn it, in that case...

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:40.120
Hey, stop that! You'll break it!

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:41.090
No way!

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:44.250
You think I'll just sit back while that guy gets all the action?

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:45.650
Stop it!

00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:46.860
No way in hell!

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:48.000
Work, damn it!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.870
Aniki, I'll help out!

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:51.670
All right, all right!

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:56.840
Yoshino, are you sure about this?

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:01.260
Letting him have his way is better than a broken machine and Tohma being stuck over there...

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:02.090
Listen!

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:07.030
I'm sending you to the coordinates where we lost Tohma. Make sure to bring him back, okay?

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:08.640
Whatever, just do it!

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:12.070
I can't help you when you get to the other side.

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:13.580
Like I even need it.

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:14.440
Oh, really.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:16.190
Well, just remember this.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:21.490
Return to where you first entered by 0500. That's where I'll bring you both back.

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:24.410
Bah, it's like having a curfew.

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:27.410
Transfer preparations at 38%.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.590
Digital Harmonizer aligning.

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:31.980
Security opening.

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:34.830
Aniki, I'm kinda nervous...

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:36.430
Don't get scared now, idiot.

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:36.940
Digital Gate Open!

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:38.210
Whoa!

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:40.170
5 seconds to transfer.

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:41.560
4...

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:42.340
You sure this is okay?

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:42.470
3...

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:43.560
You think I know?

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:43.570
2...

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:43.880
1...

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:45.590
Beginning transportation!

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:55.000
It's up to you now.

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:07.520
Break into the Digital World!

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:07.520
Drimogemon's Trap

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:05.900
Break into the Digital World!

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:07.510
Drimogemon's Trap!

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:13.230
This is the Digital World?

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:16.090
Cool... The sky and ground are upside-down!

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:17.060
Aniki?

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:19.150
You're the one who's upside-down.

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:20.290
I knew that.

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:23.670
This is the Digital World?

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:27.530
It's my first time seeing it, too.

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:28.780
But you're a Digimon, aren't you?

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:32.690
Yeah, but I've been in DATS all my life.

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:37.290
Hey, it's not all that different from our world.

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:39.120
Aniki! Over here!

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:41.960
What a blocky river...

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:44.730
I get it.

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:46.230
This is digitalized.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:49.340
Look, Aniki! They're here, too!

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:50.220
They're flying!

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:52.050
And them!

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:53.180
They're bouncing!

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:54.920
And them!

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:56.140
They're walking!

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.680
Really interesting, isn't it, Aniki?

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:00.990
Hey, we're not here for sightseeing.

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:01.990
Let's get going.

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:03.110
Where to?

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.660
We're looking for that mole thing.

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:08.610
If we keep walking, we should come across a clue or something.

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:09.610
What about Tohma?

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:14.030
Leave him, he'll figure something out on his own.

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:15.930
... If he said that, what'll we do?

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:17.290
You're over-thinking it.

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:21.020
Leave him, he'll figure something out on his own.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:21.750
That's true.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:27.750
It's huge!

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:30.300
What's that?

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:32.000
It's glittering.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.260
It's pretty.

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:52.490
All the stuff here is pretty random.

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:55.910
But it feels kinda nostalgic.

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:56.950
Really?

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:00.900
Something wrong?

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:02.500
Aniki, something's coming.

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:04.630
Wh-What's that?

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:12.080
It's Drimogemon!

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.510
He came right to us!

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:17.890
What the...?

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:28.780
He got away.

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:31.190
Hey, you, hold up!

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:36.690
Masaru's gone, too...

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:38.670
This may be the worst...

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:43.070
Try to expand the search limits!

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:46.150
Please, if I can at least locate his position on the monitor...

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:47.600
What are you doing?

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:49.470
Searching for an idiot!

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:51.590
Geez, why me?

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.490
Captain...

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.200
Looks like you are searching for something,

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:01.190
but just what are you searching for?

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:02.840
Um...

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.610
A rich bachelor!

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:07.290
Just kidding...

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.530
La... Lalamon...

00:08:10.530 --> 00:08:12.240
I think I'll stay out of this...

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:16.110
Damn it! Wait up!

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:19.990
Light!

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:22.630
This is...

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:27.350
Doesn't matter where this is!

00:08:27.350 --> 00:08:28.250
Let's go, Agumon!

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:28.710
O-Okay!

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:31.950
Take him down with one hit!

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:33.180
Yeah!

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:35.800
What? He dug down again!

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:39.990
Over there!

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:42.770
Now he's over there!

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:44.800
Aniki!

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:54.240
Stay still, damn it!

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:06.410
Aniki!

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:08.120
Idiot, don't get scared over something like this!

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:20.680
Oww...

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:23.560
We're pretty tough, Aniki.

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:24.310
It's you two!

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:27.480
Tohma!

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:28.380
Gaomon!

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:37.960
So, you were caught in a cave-in, too?

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:39.930
What's this?

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:42.770
Does that mean the same thing happened to you?

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.830
I see, you're just like us!

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:51.480
Master!

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:53.420
We can get out this way!

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:54.800
Really? Well done!

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:58.720
Hey, you're hurt!

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:01.800
This barely counts as an injury.

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:03.680
Here.

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:04.940
Stop that.

00:10:04.940 --> 00:10:06.790
I don't need you to help-

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.230
When you're a man...

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:13.020
When you're a man, there are some things you just have to <i>do</i>  despite yourself.

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:17.390
You're making me cry, Aniki!

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:18.570
Let's get outta here first.

00:10:18.570 --> 00:10:20.690
Then we can think about other things!

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:44.550
Damn it! What the hell is this?!

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:47.170
This is Drimogemon's den.

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:50.850
All of these caves have made it into a natural labyrinth.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.570
You fools!

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:59.040
How could you violate the rules?

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:02.180
You sent them to the Digital World unauthorized?

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:04.330
Do you know what you've done?!

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.380
But that was all I could do...

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:07.710
That doesn't matter.

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:12.020
Instead of berating them, we should find out where they are quickly!

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:17.170
Hey, why didn't you evolve Gaomon and break out?

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.650
I would've done that already, if I could.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:21.250
What d'you mean?

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:22.810
Gaomon.

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:23.090
Yes.

00:11:26.130 --> 00:11:27.400
An earthquake!

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:32.540
Because there are so many burrows in here, it's unstable.

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:35.570
If I have him evolve, there'll be another cave-in.

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:36.360
I get it.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:39.820
Another fork?

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:41.750
It's that way!

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:42.990
No, this way.

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:44.090
Why?

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:47.870
I'm not like you. If we move around randomly, we'll never get out of here.

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:49.090
But why?

00:11:49.090 --> 00:11:49.790
Look at that.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:51.660
Money?

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:53.530
It's a coin I dropped.

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:55.750
That means we've gone that way before.

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:00.020
Hey, you're pretty smart!

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:02.770
As I said, I'm not like you.

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:10.970
Aniki...

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:13.640
When are we gonna get outta here?!

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:15.250
Don't worry!

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:17.990
Keep up your spirits and we'll use it to work this out somehow!

00:12:17.990 --> 00:12:21.730
Spirit has nothing to do with it, but we <i>are</i>  heading up.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:24.140
You're really unbearable.

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:24.650
You, too.

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:31.320
Have you found the signals from their Digivices yet?

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:33.300
It'll take a little longer.

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:35.080
There's too much static!

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:36.340
Hurry!

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:46.640
Doesn't look like we can get down from here!

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:49.490
No choice, let's go back.

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:50.510
Master!

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:52.700
Hey, are you okay?

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:53.900
It's nothing.

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:55.690
Aniki, it's Drimogemon!

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:55.980
What?

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:00.820
He's out of luck to meet us here! Let's go, Agumon!

00:13:01.470 --> 00:13:02.750
What?!

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:04.650
Didn't you hear me when I said it's unstable here?!

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:07.800
Then we'll just have to fight without evolving!

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:09.300
Think about what you're saying.

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:11.040
He's at an advantage here.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:12.910
We can't win without evolving!

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:14.330
Then what do we do?

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:15.690
Let him pass us.

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:17.460
We have to head for the surface first.

00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:21.810
Not gonna!

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:22.420
What?

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:24.740
I'm not gonna run or hide!

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:26.410
A man takes his fights head-on!

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:27.430
What are you doing?

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:29.260
Agumon, Gaomon, come on!

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:30.890
First, we've just gotta move!

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:35.020
Aniki!

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:35.980
Master!

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:44.690
Grab onto his fur and don't let go!

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:46.900
Stop...!

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:51.150
Yo.

00:13:58.240 --> 00:14:00.290
You think you can... knock me off?!

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:04.050
His drill!

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:05.260
He's going to make another cave!

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:11.390
Hey, not that way!

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:15.270
Oww!

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:30.340
Whoo-hoo!

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:32.960
All right, we surfaced!

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:33.620
Yeah.

00:14:33.780 --> 00:14:34.810
He...

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:39.790
Did he plan all of this from the start? But wait...

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:42.790
<i>First, we've just gotta move!</i>

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:46.710
Master! We should jump off now!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.210
Hang on!

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:54.970
This way, mole!

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:03.610
Yahoo!

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:05.020
This is just like a rodeo!

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.030
Where are you taking us?

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:10.660
You're the one who said to think of a good battleground!

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:11.070
What?

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:12.780
That!

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:14.240
Yeah!

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:17.050
That place works perfectly!

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:18.910
A Coliseum?

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.080
All right!

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.410
Jump right in!

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:32.090
Of course.

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:35.380
In here, Drimogemon can't dig away and escape!

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:39.170
All that's left is to beat this guy!

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:43.560
Let's go, Agumon!

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:45.270
At last!

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:51.140
Digisoul Charge!

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:57.750
Agumon, evolve!

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:11.600
GeoGreymon!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:14.570
Let's join them!

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:15.510
Yes, Master!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.610
Digisoul Charge!

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:26.030
Gaomon, evolve!

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:40.010
Gaogamon!

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:44.150
Let's do this, you mole bastard!

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:47.450
Wait!

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:48.000
What now?

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:50.390
Something's wrong with him.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.050
What's going on?

00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:03.430
Static removal at 89%!

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:05.160
Monitor restored!

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:06.380
Beginning scan!

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:12.730
They're all safe!

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:13.940
No, wait!

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:16.110
What's that?

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:17.820
A Digimon signal!

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:19.820
It's enlarging rapidly!

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:22.700
It's coming from a Digimon that's neither GeoGreymon nor Gaogamon!

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:24.910
That signal is...

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.560
Evolution.

00:17:31.090 --> 00:17:34.050
Digmon

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:39.240
His name is Digmon.

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:42.900
He's far more powerful and has a higher mobility than Drimogemon.

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:43.720
Don't let your guard down!

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:45.730
Things just got more interesting!

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:50.770
Mega Flame!

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:53.940
Did you get him?

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:01.070
Not even a scratch?

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:03.280
Spiral Blow!

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:05.400
What?

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:10.540
Mega Flame!

00:18:17.940 --> 00:18:20.010
Damn it, is that how you wanna play it?

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:20.340
Hey!

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:23.190
Do you remember the last fight?

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:24.100
The last one?

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:29.270
Back then, Gaogamon and GeoGreymon's attacks clashed and canceled each other out.

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:36.550
But what if the opposite happened?

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:38.010
What'd happen?

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.390
Let's find out!

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.240
Isn't that your style?

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:43.240
Now you're getting it!

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:44.100
Gaogamon!

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:44.750
GeoGreymon!

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:45.910
Come back!

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:45.910
Come back!

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:51.050
The timing has to be perfect!

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:53.370
At the signal, both of you attack.

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:53.710
Got it?

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:07.890
NOW!

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:09.850
Mega Flame!

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:12.060
Spiral Blow!

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:22.770
<b>mou nani mo nai sekai ja kandou dekinai</b>

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:22.770
<b>A world that's full of nothing can't inspire anyone</b>

00:19:18.230 --> 00:19:20.190
Cool! A flaming tornado!

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:27.730
<b>sou, kizuita sono hi kara wakaru no sa</b>

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:27.730
<b>You'll understand what I mean after the day you realize that</b>

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:29.340
The opposing attacks didn't clash... they fused!

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:29.840
<b>furue wo tomete</b>

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:29.840
<b>Stop your trembling</b>

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:33.420
Their combined powers enhanced each other and became amplified to more than before!

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:33.460
<b>hitomi wo hirake</b>

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:33.460
<b>Open your eyes</b>

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:35.490
Who cares about that!

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:38.270
<b>kimi no jikan wo tokihanate!</b>

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:38.270
<b>And liberate your time!</b>

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:36.540
All that matters now is...

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:38.280
He dies!

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:42.230
<b>mirai e Shootin' star!</b>

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:42.230
<b>Oh shootin' star to the future!</b>

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:45.520
<b>hikari no aachi egake</b>

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:45.520
<b>Draw an arch of light</b>

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:50.790
<b>todoku no sa shinjitsuzukeru naraba</b>

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:50.790
<b>As long as you keep believing, it'll reach up there</b>

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:56.590
<b>kimi wo yobu koe ga kokoro de hajiketara</b>

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:56.590
<b>When the voice that calls you bellows with the heart</b>

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:52.980
Yeah!

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:55.440
We did it! Showed him!

00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:57.370
Did you see that?!

00:19:56.590 --> 00:20:02.760
<b>subete ga hajimaru Believer!</b>

00:19:56.590 --> 00:20:02.760
<b>That's when everything will begin, Believer!</b>

00:20:09.740 --> 00:20:12.600
When you jumped down towards Drimogemon...

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:17.600
Did you plan right from the start to use him so we could get to the surface?

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:19.870
Nah, that was just spirit!

00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:22.110
But the result was great, wasn't it?

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:31.810
I hate to admit it, but I can't analyze his ability with my intellect.

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:33.950
Stop a second.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:35.310
What's up?

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:37.150
Masaru.

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:46.530
Let's work well together, Tohma.

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:51.900
Aniki's got himself another follower!

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:53.570
Master is no follower!

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:00.990
You fools!

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:07.260
You were able to make it back this time, but did you think of what would've happened if you'd failed?

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:11.140
You still know nothing of the Digital World!

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:16.560
As members of this organization, you must uphold the rules!

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:23.440
You four...

00:21:25.190 --> 00:21:26.650
Well done in returning.

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:35.000
Sir!

